{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mashinomat</i> is a relaxing  management game where you oversee a quirky business filled with vending machines. Designed for laid-back play, it blends idle progress with light, hands-on tasks like restocking and machine upkeep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage, restock &amp; relax</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run your business. Keep machines stocked and collect earnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Calm Business That Grows With You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you check in occasionally or play while multitasking, <i>Mashinomat</i> offers a cozy, rewarding loop. Keep your machines running and enjoy the gentle rhythm of a world where the machines do most of the work, but still need a caring manager.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717170?t=1746788589","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717170?t=1746788589","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717170/e73e0b6def4552d4e9572453ca4941bf805fa725/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746788589","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717170/e73e0b6def4552d4e9572453ca4941bf805fa725/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746788589","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mashinomat</i> is a relaxing  management game where you oversee a quirky business filled with vending machines. Designed for laid-back play, it blends idle progress with light, hands-on tasks like restocking and machine upkeep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage, restock &amp; relax</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run your business. Keep machine